<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">We’ve received
your request for temporary loan modification due to the Covid-19 pandemic. <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">We understand
these are extremely difficult times and small businesses have been hit
especially hard. To expedite your request, please provide the following
documents:<o:p></o:p></span></p><div style=""><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"></p><ul style=""><li style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="">{!Case.Last_Month__c}<font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;bank statements</span></font></font></li><li style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="">{!Case.Current_Month__c}<font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;month to date bank transaction history</span></font></font></li></ul><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">For faster processing, please answer the following:</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"></p><ul style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><li style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">What payment assistance are you looking for?</font></li><ul style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><li style="font-family: arial;">i.e.
      partial or 50% payments, etc.</li></ul><li style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">When will you be able to resume payment?&nbsp;</font></li><ul style=""><li style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Please provide a date or estimated date</font></li></ul></ul><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Please reply to this email with all the requested information and attachments. Once received, our team will review and a credit manager will respond as soon as possible*. We wish you and your family the best during this difficult time. Visit our site for updates and support for our customers:&nbsp;</font><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12pt;">{!Case.Email_Website_Address__c}</span></p></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;">Thank you,&nbsp;</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><br></div><div style=""><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><div style=""><font face="arial">Loan Modification Team&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></div></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p class="MsoNormal" style="background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b>{!Case.Email_Signature_Company__c}</b></font></p></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-size: medium;">9820 Towne Centre Drive</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: medium; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial">San Diego, CA 92121</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: medium; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;"><b><span style="font-size:12.0pt;
color:red">*To ensure your request is processed in a timely manner:</span></b><b><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:red"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>

<ul style="margin-top: 0in;" type="disc">
 <li class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst" style="color: red; font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-left: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;"><b><span lang="EN" style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;mso-fareast-font-family:
     &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN">Reply directly to this email with
     all the requested attachments and information</span></b></li><li class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst" style="color: red; font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-left: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;"><b style="font-size: 12pt;"><span lang="EN" style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;mso-fareast-font-family:
